<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Verify your email</title>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>Welcome!</h1>
    <p>Your email verification code is:</p>
    <h2 style="letter-spacing: 8px; font-size: 32px; text-align: center; padding: 16px; background: #f3f4f6; border-radius: 8px;">{{otp}}</h2>
    <p>This code will expire in 10 minutes.</p>
    <p>If you did not request this, please ignore this email.</p>
    <hr style="margin-top: 32px; border: none; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;" />
    <p style="color: #6b7280; font-size: 12px; text-align: center;">{{appName}}</p>
</body>
</html>
